    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto Jonah the son of Amittai, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, go to Nineveh, that great city, and cry against it; for their wickedness is come up before me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jonah rose up to flee unto Tarshish from the presence of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and went down to Joppa; and he found a ship going to Tarshish: so he paid the fare thereof, and went down into it, to go with them unto Tarshish from the presence of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent out a great wind into the sea, and there was a mighty tempest in the sea, so that the ship was like to be broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the mariners were afraid, and cried every man unto his god, and cast forth the wares that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the ship into the sea, to lighten",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of them. But Jonah was gone down into the sides of the ship; and he lay, and was fast asleep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the shipmaster came to him, and said unto him, What meanest thou, O sleeper? arise, call upon thy God, if so be that God will think upon us, that we perish not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said every one to his fellow, Come, and let us cast lots, that we may know for whose cause this evil",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon us. So they cast lots, and the lot fell upon Jonah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said they unto him, Tell us, we pray thee, for whose cause this evil",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon us; What",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thine occupation? and whence comest thou? what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy country? and of what people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto them, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an Hebrew; and I fear the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of heaven, which hath made the sea and the dry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "land",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then were the men exceedingly afraid, and said unto him, Why hast thou done this? For the men knew that he fled from the presence of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", because he had told them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then said they unto him, What shall we do unto thee, that the sea may be calm unto us? for the sea wrought, and was tempestuous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto them, Take me up, and cast me forth into the sea; so shall the sea be calm unto you: for I know that for my sake this great tempest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless the men rowed hard to bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the land; but they could not: for the sea wrought, and was tempestuous against them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore they cried unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and said, We beseech thee, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", we beseech thee, let us not perish for this man's life, and lay not upon us innocent blood: for thou, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", hast done as it pleased thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they took up Jonah, and cast him forth into the sea: and the sea ceased from her raging.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.1.15"
            ]
          }
